cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use sievesafe, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "sievesafe: zero-shot title/abstract screening that only auto-excludes when it is safe to"
abstract: >-
  Title/abstract screening for systematic reviews with a zero-shot probabilistic model (TypeSafe Jev) and a safe
  exclusion threshold frozen before evaluation, validated on SYNERGY+ and pre-registered on CLEF TAR.
authors:
